            "id": "scavenger",
            "label": "Scavenger",
            "origin": "The Reach",
            "description": "The narrow alleys and bustling streets of Freehaven are your home. You grew up scavenging what you could and selling what you had to. A week ago, you signed on to a contract guiding a noble through the blighted Sundered Lands."
        },
        {
            "id": "soldier",
            "label": "Ex-Soldier",
            "origin": "Polaris",
            "description": "After refusing an order that would have lined a Syndicate captain's pockets, you were framed for theft and stripped of your rank. After that, you were easy to disappear."
        },
        {
            "id": "refugee",
            "label": "Refugee",
            "origin": "Murmansk",
            "description": "You fled the fall of Murmansk with nothing. Stateless and undocumented, you were exactly the kind of person the Syndicate preys on... there was nobody to report you missing."
        },
        {
            "id": "steward",
            "label": "Steward",
            "origin": "Svea",
            "description": "You served a wealthy household in Svea until your employer fell into catastrophic debt with the Syndicate. When they came to collect, they took the staff along with the furniture."
        }
    ],
